# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
import lib/cadkernel/nurbs_builder.dl
import tests/cadkernel/cross2/support.dl

function check rational builder {boolean:condition}:
    execute:
        if condition = false:
            @intrinsic("call", "libc", "abort", nothing)
function rational builder scalar {a 64 bit floating-point number:actual} near {a 64 bit floating-point number:expected}:
    execute:
        check rational builder ((the absolute value of (actual - expected)) < 1e-12)

set source to cross2 segment [1.0,2.0] to [4.0,6.0]
set made to the cad rational builder of source
check rational builder made's valid
set line to made's value
check rational builder (line's degree = 1)
check rational builder ((the length of line's controls) = 2)
check rational builder ((the cad distance from (the item at 1 in (line's controls)) to (cross2 point [4.0,6.0])) < 1e-12)
set converted to the cad curve of line
check rational builder converted's valid
print "line_builder_preserves_endpoints" as a line

set arc to the cad rational unit arc with sweep 1.5707963267948966
check rational builder arc's valid
set arcCurve to the cad curve of arc's value
check rational builder arcCurve's valid
set midpoint to the cad point on arcCurve's value at 0.5
rational builder scalar midpoint's x near 0.7071067811865476
rational builder scalar midpoint's y near 0.7071067811865476
check rational builder ((the length of arc's value's controls) = 3)
set complete to the cad rational builder of (cross2 circle [0.0,0.0] with radius 2.0)
check rational builder ((the length of complete's value's controls) = 9)
print "conics_use_exact_rational_quadratics" as a line

set invalid to the cad rational unit arc with sweep 0.0
check rational builder (invalid's valid = false)
set invalid to the cad rational builder of (cross2 ray [0.0,0.0] along [1.0,0.0])
check rational builder (invalid's valid = false)
print "unsupported_curves_and_empty_sweeps_are_refused" as a line

set points to a list containing (cross2 point [0.0,0.0])
append (cross2 point [2.0,3.0]) to points
set knots to a list containing 2.0
append 2.0 to knots
append 6.0 to knots
append 6.0 to knots
set weights to a list containing 1.0
append 2.0 to weights
set nurbs to the strict cad nurbs curve2 of degree 1 with controls points, knots knots and weights weights
check rational builder nurbs's valid
set normalized to the cad rational builder of (the cad curve2 of nurbs's value)
check rational builder normalized's valid
rational builder scalar (the item at 0 in (normalized's value's knots)) near 0.0
rational builder scalar (the item at 3 in (normalized's value's knots)) near 1.0
print "existing_nurbs_domains_are_normalized" as a line

set reversed to the cad reverse of normalized's value
check rational builder ((the cad distance from (the item at 0 in (reversed's controls)) to (cross2 point [2.0,3.0])) < 1e-12)
rational builder scalar (the item at 0 in (reversed's weights)) near 2.0
set again to the cad reverse of reversed
check rational builder ((the cad distance from (the item at 0 in (again's controls)) to (cross2 point [0.0,0.0])) < 1e-12)
print "reversal_preserves_control_weight_pairs" as a line

set frame to a cad plane with origin (a cad vector3 with x 10.0, y 20.0 and z 30.0), x axis (a cad vector3 with x 1.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0) and y axis (a cad vector3 with x 0.0, y 0.0 and z 1.0)
set lifted to the cad lift of line onto frame
set offset to a cad vector3 with x 0.0, y 5.0 and z 0.0
set translated to the cad translation of lifted by offset
set first to the item at 0 in (translated's controls)
rational builder scalar first's x near 11.0
rational builder scalar first's y near 25.0
rational builder scalar first's z near 32.0
set spatial to the cad curve of translated
check rational builder spatial's valid
print "lifting_and_translation_preserve_the_rational_basis" as a line

check rational builder (lifted is cad compatible with translated)
set ruled to the cad ruled surface from lifted to translated
check rational builder ruled's valid
set atMiddle to the cad point on ruled's value at parameters 0.5 and 0.5
rational builder scalar atMiddle's x near 12.5
rational builder scalar atMiddle's y near 22.5
rational builder scalar atMiddle's z near 34.0
set different to the cad lift of arc's value onto frame
check rational builder ((lifted is cad compatible with different) = false)
set refused to the cad ruled surface from lifted to different
check rational builder (refused's valid = false)
print "ruled_surfaces_require_compatible_bases" as a line

set raw to the cad rational curve2 of degree 0 with controls points, knots knots and weights weights
set strict to the cad curve of raw
check rational builder (strict's valid = false)
check rational builder ((the length of raw's controls) = 2)
free points
free knots
free weights
print "intermediate_builders_defer_strict_validation" as a line
